{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06285","headline":"上巳 · 崔颢","name":"上巳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巳日帝城春，倾都祓禊晨。\n停车须傍水，奏乐要惊尘。\n弱柳障行骑，浮桥拥看人。\n犹言日尚早，更向九龙津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}